  "implementation": [
    "Canonical complete-state history is the only chain, consensus, node, and storage authority. Retired block/candidate/payload APIs and their V0 branches, journals, recovery capabilities, and driver are removed.",
    "Shared vote role/root types, quorum/proposer arithmetic, file locking, append order, Unix directory synchronization, Windows write-through/destination flush and local-NTFS checks remain; signer still requires Unix.",
    "No state rule, limit, wire encoding, golden vector, history filename, or accepted mathematical admission order changed in this milestone.",
    "Linux CI exposed ETXTBSY on a newly generated test-provider executable. A stable checked-in launcher is hard-linked into a private fixture directory on the same filesystem; generated shell bodies are read as input. Production provider invocation is unchanged; full timeout/exit/descendant assertions remain.",
    "Ownership and codec contracts describe the sole canonical path. Retired V0 specifications are explicitly historical; shared proposer arithmetic remains current."
  ],
  "coverage_mapping": {
    "canonical_retained": "All canonical state/ledger/consensus/history/signer/anchor-fault/settlement/runtime/network/process/portable-replay tests remain.",
    "unit_safety_model": "Exhaustive four Byzantine placements, three rounds, two values under two-million-state bound per placement. Fourteen witness labels include mixed-target timeout and two-signer catch-up. Both weak-quorum and forgotten-lock mutants produce counterexamples.",
    "real_signer_replay": "Witnesses use real anchored honest signer journals from one execution. Only the faulty key is directly signed. Reopen checks exact snapshots and retry publications; finality checks complete state and signer height reset.",
    "quorum_boundary": "128 actual signed-vote subsets: sixteen subsets, two roles, four Byzantine placements; matching finality and exact quorum re-encoding.",
    "shared_weight_math": "19,164 eligible small configurations checked directly, 19 symmetry classes, scaled full-u128 representatives and exact two-thirds boundaries. This is shared arithmetic evidence, not weighted canonical-node qualification.",
    "cross_process_custody": "Portable history owner and independent-anchor locks; Unix signer owner and independent-anchor locks. Eight cycles each, real child processes, Locked while held and immediate first-attempt reopen after release.",
    "proof_decoders": "Moved 2,048-case malformed-input and seed mutation campaign to ledger, preserving formula/proof/payload/artifact-set checks; removed only retired block/chain formats.",
    "retired_only": "Old V0 tests tied to removed artifacts, branches, journals, weighted-node authority and driver APIs are removed with their implementations."
  },
